OTHER PROGRAMS
==============
If you are satisfied with the quality and craftsmanship of these fine
utilities, you may want to look at our other C-Net Secondary Support
Utilities if you haven't already discovered them.

AutoMod.LZH will help you upgrade all your text files (BBSTEXT, BBSMENU, etc.)
            to any new version of C-Net.

GIF.LZH     will allow your users to use the Examine command in the UDBase to
            see the pixel width, height, colors, and GIF Signature of any
            GIF file (with an extension of .GIF).

All these files are available on Future World and The Phone Booth BBS - and
probably from other C-Net SysOps.


AUTOMODIFICATION BLOCKS
=======================
For an instant, quick upgrading of your BBSTEXT file to use
SpeakerLogoff.v2.1, SpeakerChat.v2.1, and ChatRanQuote.v2, use the following
AutoModification Blocks:

99
@ Logoff complete\n1
\#0PFiles:SpeakerLogoff.v2.1\@ Logoff complete\n1

159
\n1Enter a reason for wanting to chat.\n1:
\#0PFiles:SpeakerChat.v2.1\

162
\n1Now paging the Sysop!\$0sound SysData:chat.snd\\n1
\#0PFiles:ChatRanQuote.v2\\n1

You should add SpeakerLogon.v2.1 to your SysText:sys.Welcome file by hand
since I have no idea how you want it to be added.


Thank you for showing interest in our software.  We're always open to
suggestions and ideas.  Please let us know what you think about our software.

